ywords/nyt_des">Spying and Intelligence Agencies</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Alice Huang</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Adultery</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Board of directors</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Artificial intelligence</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Computers and the Internet</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Tech Industry</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">China</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">live-detached</category><media:content url="https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/11/11/multimedia/00biz-jensen-huang-gzlb/00biz-jensen-huang-gzlb-videoSixteenByNineJumbo1600-v2.jpg" medium="image"><media:credit>Manuel Orbegozo for The New York Times</media:credit><media:description>Few Silicon Valley executives have been as synonymous with their companies as Jensen Huang, the co-founder and chief executive of Nvidia.</media:description></media:content></item><item><title>We Were Warned of Deceptive A.I. Fakes. We Got Memes.</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/12/technology/artifical-intelligence-fakes-midterm-memes.html?partner=rss&amp;emc=rss</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/12/technology/artifical-intelligence-fakes-midterm-memes.html?partner=rss&amp;emc=rss</guid><atom:link rel="standout" href="https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/12/technology/artifical-intelligence-fakes-midterm-memes.html?partner=rss&amp;emc=rss" /><description>The surge of A.I. fakes that emerged this election season was different than what researchers had feared. The results are also a reckoning.</description><dc:creator>Stuart A. Thompson</dc:creator><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2